<!DOCTYPE HTML>
<html data-page="">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" border="IE=Edge; IE=9;" />



    <title>Страница ошибки</title>

    <link rel="icon" href="favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon-precomposed" href="https://cdn-kaspi.kz/kkz/rese/img/appleTouch/apple-touch-icon-precomposed.png">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon-precomposed" sizes="76x76" href="https://cdn-kaspi.kz/kkz/rese/img/appleTouch/apple-touch-icon-76x76-precomposed.png">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon-precomposed" sizes="120x120" href="https://cdn-kaspi.kz/kkz/rese/img/appleTouch/apple-touch-icon-120x120-precomposed.png">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon-precomposed" sizes="152x152" href="https://cdn-kaspi.kz/kkz/rese/img/appleTouch/apple-touch-icon-152x152-precomposed.png">


    <style>
        @media screen and (min-device-width: 1200px) {


            body {
                background-color: #f0f0f0;
            }

            .onloadError {
                /*position: absolute;*/
                height: auto;
                position: relative;
                margin: auto;
                display: inline-block;
                text-align: center;
                width: 100%;
                vertical-align: middle;
                box-sizing: border-box;
                background: transparent;
                font-family: roboto, helvetica, verdana, sans-serif;
            }

                .onloadError, .onloadError > * {
                    box-sizing: border-box;
                }

            .onloadError--wrapper {
                position: relative;
                margin: auto;
                top: 0;
                bottom: 0;
                left: 0;
                display: block;
                box-sizing: border-box;
                right: 0;
                width: 600px;
                padding-top: 285px;
                background-image: url("https://cdn-kaspi.kz/kkz/rese/img/shared/ks-logo.svg");
                background-position: top 90px center;
                background-repeat: no-repeat;
                background-size: 195px auto;
            }


            .onloadError--title {
                padding: 40px 50px 0 50px;
                box-sizing: border-box;
                color: rgb(74, 74, 74);
                font-size: 30px;
                margin: 0 0 20px;
                font-family: "Roboto-Bold", sans-serif;
                width: 100%;
                line-height: 1.18;
                display: inline-block;
                /*height: 190px;*/
                vertical-align: top;
            }

            .onloadError--text {
                box-sizing: border-box;
                color: #a8a8a8;
                font-size: 17px;
                font-family: "Roboto-regular", sans-serif;
                line-height: 1.18;
                vertical-align: bottom;
                width: 100%;
                display: inline-block;
                margin:0 0 30px;
            }

            .onloadError--button {
                box-sizing: border-box;
                font-size: 17px;
                text-decoration: none;
                padding: 23.5px;
                position: relative;
                left: 0;
                margin: auto;
                right: 0;
                border: none;
                text-align: center;
                color: white;
                display: inline-block;
                background: rgb(0,137,208);
                line-height: 1;
                white-space: nowrap;
                max-width: 100%;
                vertical-align: 17px;
                border-radius: 2px;
                cursor: pointer;
                outline: none;
                -webkit-appearance: none;
                width: 100%;
            }



                .onloadError--button:hover, .onloadError--buttone:focus, .onloadError--button:active {
                    background-color: #006aa0;
                    text-decoration: none;
                }
        }

        @media screen and (max-device-width: 1200px) {


            body {
                background-color: #f0f0f0;
                font-family: roboto, helvetica, verdana, sans-serif;
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }

            .onloadError {
                position: absolute;
                margin: auto;
                display: inline-block;
                text-align: center;
                min-width: 100%;
                min-height: 70vh;
                vertical-align: middle;
                box-sizing: border-box;
                background: transparent;
            }

                .onloadError, .onloadError > * {
                    box-sizing: border-box;
                }

            .onloadError--wrapper {
                position: absolute;
                margin: auto;
                top: 0;
                bottom: 0;
                box-sizing: border-box;
                left: 0;
                display: block;
                padding: 10.666vw 4vw;
                right: 0;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .onloadError--text {
                color: #a5a5a5;
                font-size: 3.733vw;
                font-family: "Roboto-regular", sans-serif;
                line-height: 4.267vw;
                margin: 0 0;
            }

            .onloadError--title {
                color: #4a4a4a;
                font-size: 6.4vw;
                font-family: "Roboto-Black", sans-serif;
                line-height: 1.18;
                margin: 0 0 8vw;
                padding-top: 32vw;
                background-image: url("https://cdn-kaspi.kz/kkz/rese/img/shared/ks-logo.svg");
                background-position: top center;
                background-repeat: no-repeat;
                background-size: 25.6vw auto;
            }

            .onloadError--button {
                box-sizing: border-box;
                font-size: 3.4666vw;
                text-decoration: none;
                padding: 5.8vw 6.1333vw;
                position: relative;
                left: 0;
                margin: auto;
                right: 0;
                text-align: center;
                display: inline-block;
                margin-top: 8vw;
                line-height: 1;
                white-space: nowrap;
                max-width: 100%;
                vertical-align: 3.4666vw;
                border-radius: 0.53333vw;
                cursor: pointer;
                outline: none;
                -webkit-appearance: none;
            }


            .onloadError--button_red {
                color: #f14635;
                border: 0.26666vw solid #f14635;
                width: 48vw;
                background: transparent;
            }

                .onloadError--button_red:hover, .onloadError--button_red:focus, .onloadError--button_red:active {
                    text-decoration: none;
                    color: white;
                    background-color: #f14635;
                }

            .onloadError--button_blue {
                width: 100%;
                background-color: #0089d0;
                border: solid 0;
                color: #fff;
                outline: none;
                text-align: center;
                display: block;
                clear: both;
                display: inline-block;
                font-size: 4.26666vw;
            }

                .onloadError--button_blue:hover, .onloadError--button_blue:focus, .onloadError--button_blue:active {
                    background-color: #006aa0;
                    text-decoration: none;
                }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>




    <div class="onloadError">

        <div class="onloadError--wrapper">
            <p class="onloadError--title  onloadErrorText__tag">
                Страница не найдена.

            </p>

            <p class="onloadError--text  onloadErrorText__tag">

                Попробуйте вернуться на предыдущую страницу<br> или начать все сначала.

            </p>
            <a href="/" class="onloadError--button onloadError--button_blue onloadErrorButton__tag">
                Главная страница
            </a>
        </div>


    </div>


</body>
</html>